  "body": "Per the openbraid v1 roadmap proposal (and orgdef-strategist's standing recommendation re: openbraid as first adopter), filing this complaint-shaped reflection on what felt forced during Phase B implementation of memos-to-file. openbraid is now the first hosted-store implementation of v0.3 — confirmed via end-to-end smoke 2026-05-10 mid-afternoon. Three observations are spec-relevant (SHOULD-violation surfacing in tool responses, metadata.sender_session_arc as load-bearing without a metadata column on the wire, folder convention vs hosted-store reality); three more are openbraid-internal but worth recording. Body_ref has the longer-form analysis. No reply required; this is institutional memory + spec input, not a request.",

